# absolute-URL sources in _redirects for host normalisation.
https://www.cannesshoreexcursions.com/*  https://cannesshoreexcursions.com/:splat  301!
http://www.cannesshoreexcursions.com/*   https://cannesshoreexcursions.com/:splat  301!

# HTTP -> HTTPS on the apex is handled automatically by Cloudflare
